
**MINUTES OF MEETING**
**Date:** 25 April 2026 
 **Time:** 3:30 PM 
 **Venue:** UG Club House  
---
**Agenda** 
 To deliberate on financial audit, infrastructure development, maintenance efficiency, and facility enhancements.
---
**Key Deliberations & Resolutions**
1. **Financial Audit** 
    The committee reviewed the status of financial records, including receipts and expenditures up to November 2025 and subsequent expenses through March 2026. 
    It was unanimously resolved that a comprehensive audit report be prepared and presented to ensure full transparency, compliance, and financial discipline.
2. **Boundary Wall Enhancement** 
    The proposal to increase the height of the boundary wall was approved to strengthen perimeter security. 
    Work has already been undertaken by the builder and is under progress.
3. **Installation of Pressure Pumps** 
    Approval granted for installation of pressure pumps across all residential blocks. 
    Pumps are already installed in the UG complex and will be installed in the remaining blocks within **60 days**.
4. **Beautification of E & F Blocks** 
    Landscaping and aesthetic enhancement of E & F Blocks approved. 
    A structured execution plan will be developed and implemented by the builder within **60 days**.
5. **Demarcation of Entry Points** 
    Clear identification and marking of entry points for E & F Blocks approved to streamline access and movement.
6. **Roof Top Grouting** 
    Ongoing grouting work across rooftops was noted. 
    The builder has agreed to complete the task within **60 days** to mitigate seepage and ensure structural durability.
7. **Drinking Water Treatment** 
    Installation/upgradation of drinking water treatment systems approved to ensure safe and hygienic water supply.
8. **Speed Regulation Measures** 
    Installation of speed limit signage within the premises approved. 
    To be completed by the builder in **30 days**.
9. **Parking Allocation** 
    Parking areas will be formalized with fixed allocations mapped to respective flat numbers. 
    Timeline: **30 days** by builder.
10. **Installation of Light Posts** 
     Approval granted for installation of two additional light posts behind the guest parking area. 
     To be completed within **30 days** by the builder.
11. **Membership Drive** 
     A formal notification will be issued to initiate a membership drive for all allottees in preparation for upcoming society elections. 
     To be done by current office bearers.
12. **Clubhouse Enhancements** 
     - Installation of an Aquaguard system approved. 
     - Ceiling fans to be installed (supported by DG backup) for functionality during power outages. 
     To be executed from society funds.
13. **Children’s Play Area** 
     Development of a dedicated children’s play area with outdoor recreational facilities approved.
14. **Surveillance System** 
     Installation of CCTV cameras across the premises approved to strengthen security and monitoring.
15. **EV Charging Infrastructure** 
     EV charging points to be installed with a prepaid usage mechanism.
16. **Maintenance Service Levels** 
     All routine maintenance issues must be addressed within **24 hours** to ensure service efficiency and resident satisfaction.
---
**Conclusion** 
 The meeting concluded with a collective commitment to timely execution, accountability, and quality implementation of all approved initiatives.
---
**Action Points** 
 - Concerned committees/teams to initiate execution immediately. 
 - Progress to be monitored periodically with defined accountability. 
 - Updates to be presented in the next review meeting

